  "details": "Please show each world's like/dislike counts or ratio on the world page. To keep this from being botted or review-bombed, only count votes from age-verified accounts toward the public numbers. Everyone can still vote to shape their own recommendations, but only verified votes would appear publicly.\n\nCreators who want to improve can use the ratings as honest feedback, and players can decide which worlds to visit. Hiding the numbers protects bad uploads and AI-generated junk worlds more than it protects real creators. If a world is good, the ratio will show it.",
